{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17769","headline":"送杜郎中使君赴虔州 · 杨巨源","name":"送杜郎中使君赴虔州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢遰南康路，清辉得使君。\n虎符秋领俗，鵷署早辞羣。\n地远仍连戍，城严本带军。\n傍江低槛月，当岭满牕云。\n境胜闾阎间，天清水陆分。\n和诗将惠政，颂述九衢闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}